{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/b/17bdbabd42c80acc2d8e8e6dadc7b7afd91968a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3] {5+2\\sqrt{13}}+\\sqrt[3]{5-2\\sqrt{13}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"206\" height=\"32\" /> equals \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b7ee865b061b3278bcf81aca65d35e47d85f783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\frac 32 \\qquad  \\text{(B)} \\ \\frac{\\sqrt[3]{65}}{4} \\qquad  \\text{(C)} \\ \\frac{1+\\sqrt[6]{13}}{2} \\qquad  \\text{(D)}\\ \\sqrt[3]{2}\\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"525\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/f/fcf49ed840ec692380b8f8f16ff1e6fd586a0683.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\sqrt[3] {5+2\\sqrt{13}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"128\" height=\"35\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/6/1a69b3319e7a5b793cd375213503506703cb9b06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\sqrt[3]{5-2\\sqrt{13}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"127\" height=\"35\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a21d78bb48530bdd901373998d0f5c9c99653b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt[3] {5+2\\sqrt{13}}+\\sqrt[3]{5-2\\sqrt{13}} = y + z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"308\" height=\"35\" />. \n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/46848a33e0830e19d72024259bd82ed58efc6c8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 = (y+z)^3 = y^3 + 3y^2z + 3yz^2 + z^3 = y^3 + z^3 + 3yz(y+z) = y^3 + z^3 + 3yzx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"628\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca161dba24b6c410443a80243505bccdca2bf118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^3 + z^3 = 5 + 2\\sqrt{13} + 5 - 2\\sqrt{13} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"294\" height=\"23\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea2967d0b74756cc98fee7d25239d1ec2e6834eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$yz = \\sqrt[3]{\\left(5 + 2\\sqrt{13}\\right)\\left(5-2\\sqrt{13}\\right)} = \\sqrt[3]{5^2 -\\left(2\\sqrt{13}\\right)^2} = \\sqrt[3]{-27} = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"528\" height=\"47\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/6205e18bee7c23c00f78d0a97c9d3934b524f06b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 = 10 + 3 \\cdot -3 \\cdot x = 10-9x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"237\" height=\"18\" />, that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/d/b2dc520754154c2cd23aea2152fb42245020fdfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+9x-10=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />.  This factors to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/4/6048037657edab003a779e4a3125f24ee0de7d9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(x^2+x+10) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"196\" height=\"21\" />, which has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> as its only real solution.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/7/d9705b5ec9fe8c15bc936ab279062156348c7e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3] {5+2\\sqrt{13}}+\\sqrt[3]{5-2\\sqrt{13}} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"238\" height=\"32\" /> and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7e829500989efa04665a30d0fff7c373dcda9df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{E})\\ \\textrm{none of these}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"141\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <